WEBVTT

00:13:28.236 --> 00:13:31.436
And so what these examples show to me,

00:13:31.476 --> 00:13:33.876
the reason I find them inspiring,

00:13:33.876 --> 00:13:37.596
is that I think they demonstrate
that if you get the situations right,

00:13:37.636 --> 00:13:39.876
if you get the technology upgraded,

00:13:39.916 --> 00:13:43.756
then actually the things that we do
when we come together as citizens

00:13:43.756 --> 00:13:45.596
can be astounding,

00:13:45.596 --> 00:13:48.836
and together, we really can build
a form of democracy

00:13:48.836 --> 00:13:51.756
that's genuinely fit for the 21st century.

00:13:51.796 --> 00:13:53.236
Thank you very much.

00:13:53.236 --> 00:13:55.036
(Applause)